@103242 = ~Baldur's Gate II : Adventurers of Neverwinter~
@103243 = ~Brand-new art and voice sets from Beamdog to build your character around! Customize your Baldur's Gate II: Enhanced Edition experience with this collection of eleven new character portraits and seven new voice sets. Mark Meer returns to deliver character voices for fan-favorites, Alveus Malcanter and Baeloth!

Features:
- 11 new portraits
- 7 new voice sets including two from Mark Meer!~
